/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_Foliage_LOD_Imposter_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Vegetation/M_Foliage_LOD_Imposter_Master
Target Use: Distant forest canopy LODs & HLOD billboard clusters (300m to 5000m)

OPTIMIZATION & ARCHITECTURE:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. OCTAHEDRAL / MULTI-ANGLE ATLAS:
   - Renders 16 baked views of the tree into a single texture atlas.
   - Calculates viewing vector relative to instance forward vector to look up
     the matching angle seamlessly as the player speeds along the 50km highway.
   - Param "AtlasFrames" (Scalar, Default=16.0):
   - Param "Roughness_Imposter" (Scalar, Default=0.65): Pre-integrated diffuse.

2. LIGHTING & DEPTH RECONSTRUCTION:
   - Uses pre-baked World Normal map in atlas to properly respond to directional sun.
   - Depth Offset expression restores cylindrical 3D depth to eliminate flat card clipping.

3. ATMOSPHERIC HAZE BLENDING:
   - Param "AerialPerspectiveScale" (Scalar, Default=1.0):
   - Smoothly blends imposter albedo into the distant mountain fog palette.
================================================================================
*/
